  <hr class="gold-rule">

  <p>I build websites and publications. My main project is <a href="https://thefreethinkingtimes.com">The Freethinking Times</a>, an independent publication I've run since 2022. Project Broadsheet grew out of the framework I built to run it.</p>

  <p>By day I operate <a href="https://www.pikespeakwebdesigns.com">Pikes Peak Web Designs</a>, a small web-design practice focused on performance, accessibility, and sites that last. Every project is done personally — no outsourcing, no contractors.</p>

  <p>If you'd like to work together on a publication or a web project, <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> or <a href="/book-a-call/">book a call</a>.</p>

